@startuml
title Strijder vehicle I/O — inferred functional schematic, concept A
top to bottom direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
rectangle "Vehicle CAN/sense\nJ201 — cavity map TBD" as vehicle
rectangle "D201 / optional FL201\nBus protection / EMC" as protect
rectangle "U202 CAN transceiver\nSilent hardware default" as can
rectangle "IGN_RAW\nR201–R204 / C201 / D202\nDivider, filter, coordinated clamp" as ign
rectangle "U203 comparator\nHysteresis / power-off protection" as compare
rectangle "J202 physical selector\n16-position historical concept" as selector
rectangle "U205 protected inputs\nDiscrete or bus — select one" as inputs
rectangle "U201 deterministic I/O MCU\nPolicy / expiry / feedback" as mcu
rectangle "U204 supervisor\nIndependent reset / inhibit" as watchdog
rectangle "Vision Core\nAuthenticated local requests" as vision
rectangle "U206 control interface\nAUTO_CMD_ENABLE\nEncoding and driver TBD" as driver
rectangle "Independent manual resolver\nVendor-supported path, TBD\nNot parallel output drivers" as manual
rectangle "J203 external lighting controller\nCommand arbitration / load switches" as light
rectangle "Vehicle source\nDedicated load fuse" as source
rectangle "Warning lamps\nIndividually protected branches" as lamps
rectangle "J204 / J206\nAuxiliary sensor / validator\nElectrical meaning unresolved" as aux
rectangle "J205 / U207 interlock\nUnpopulated until hazard review" as interlock
vehicle --> protect : VEH_CAN_H/L
protect --> can : protected pair
can --> mcu : VEH_RXD
mcu ..> can : VEH_TXD disabled by default
vehicle --> ign : ignition sense allocation TBD
ign --> compare : protected analog node
compare --> mcu : IGN_VALID
selector --> inputs : SEL_RAW
inputs --> mcu : SEL_VALID
selector --> manual : independent manual request
vision --> mcu : named mode / expiry
watchdog --> mcu : RESET
watchdog --> driver : inhibit automatic requests
mcu --> driver : LIGHT_CMD
driver --> light : low-level commands only
manual --> light : approved manual arbitration
light --> mcu : LIGHT_FB / faults
source -[#red]-> light : dedicated high-current power
light -[#red]-> lamps : switched load power
aux ..> mcu : protected interface TBD
mcu ..> interlock : action / feedback TBD
note bottom of lamps
Load return is separately rated to vehicle source.
Full warning-light current does not traverse compute PCB.
end note
note bottom of mcu
Named nets are proposals, not released pin assignments.
Vehicle network and private lighting network are separate.
Safe state is function-specific, not universally all-off.
end note
@enduml
